    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla",
        "text": "What a beautiful sea..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "It really is."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Looks like we wasted nothing coming to this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "How about we sit down right here, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla",
        "text": "We could also head back. I'm worried we'll be a nuisance to the others here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Don't let it weigh on you. This city doesn't seem to mind the Infected too much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Though it's very plainly not because they're open-minded, but because they don't care..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Besides, we have Sussurro with us. We'll be fine, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_199_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro",
        "text": "Yes. I'm well aware of Eyjafjalla's condition."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro",
        "text": "In my honest opinion, you should worry more about yourself than if you're troubling anyone else."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro",
        "text": "You spend more time indoors than the average person, and that doesn't just have repercussions on your body, but your mental health as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_199_1#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro",
        "text": "That's why I, as a doctor, endorsed bringing you here, Eyjafjalla."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_199_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro",
        "text": "Everyone should have the right to enjoy the sunshine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Absolutely."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "They ran into some trouble, but I heard over the screen that the Doctor took a group on vacation somewhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "It's only right that Eyjafjalla and the rest of us get one too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla",
        "text": "No, I came voluntarily to carry out geological research, and if I hold up everyone else..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Aw, come on, now, don't you worry so much."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "We came here on legitimate grounds, too. Rhodes Island wants to set up a branch office here, and we've never been able to get the mayor's approval."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Amiya's had us come here as a liaison."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "So you just relax and enjoy the competition."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla",
        "text": "Mhm. Thanks."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_190_1#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Oh, right. Where's Projekt Red?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_199_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sussurro",
        "text": "I don't think she's coming here. She went off alone somewhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_206_1#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_199_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca",
        "text": "Fine. She's been like this since forever. I'm used to it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
