        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "Maybe we should split up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "The Triathlon's extremely long. We'll lose contact fast if we all do our own thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "Save for any teams sending lone people off to obstruct others, it's principally as a joint effort."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "If you two have no opinions along that line, then I suggest we work together."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
